{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7669661822607411461","title":"AI短剧内容评估 - 番茄小说","description":"团队介绍：番茄小说是抖音在 2019 年推出的免费阅读产品，致力于为读者提供优质的阅读体验。番茄小说拥有海量正版小说，涵盖言情、都市、玄幻、悬疑等主流网文类型，以及大量热剧原著和经典出版物，支持用户看书、听书。\n\n1、从用户消费需求和AI剧内容形态出发，制定剧本的评估标准，优化IP策划与生产流程，对优质剧本的产能和质量负责；\n2、负责平台高预期AI剧评估，为评估准确率负责；\n3、跟进行业内容趋势，提炼剧内容特征，提升选题内容质量。","requirement":"1、2027届获得本科及以上学历，影视、中文、动画类相关专业优先；\n2、有AI创作经验或奖项优先；\n3、熟悉网文及漫剧，对女频、男频内容有深刻理解，热爱并深耕内容领域；\n4、内容积极性高，有良好的沟通协作精神。","job_category":{"id":"6704215961064442123","name":"内容运营","en_name":"Content ops","i18n_name":"内容运营","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"6704215882479962371","name":"运营","en_name":"Operations","i18n_name":"运营","depth":1,"children":[]},"children":[]},"city_info":{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","i18n_name":"北京"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1785732500160,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7649336829398468869","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘","i18n":"2027届校园招聘"},"active_status":1},"code":"A229937","job_id":"7668204217206720821","city_list":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京